    {
      "text": "men of truth … place such over them, to be rulers, Ex. 18:21. God of truth and without iniquity, Deut. 32:4. serve him in sincerity and in truth, Josh. 24:14. thou desirest truth in the inward parts, Ps. 51:6. Mercy and truth are met together, Ps. 85:10. Truth shall spring out of the earth, Ps. 85:11. truth of the Lord endureth for ever, Ps. 117:2. Let not mercy and truth forsake thee, Prov. 3:3. For my mouth shall speak truth, Prov. 8:7. lip of truth shall be established for ever, Prov. 12:19. Buy the truth, and sell it not, Prov. 23:23. they are not valiant for the truth, Jer. 9:3. King of heaven, all whose works are truth, Dan. 4:37. no truth … nor knowledge of God in the land, Hosea 4:1. Speak ye every man the truth, Zech. 8:16 (Eph. 4:25).",
